      "bytes": 15308685,
      "bin": "uv.exe"
    },
    "python": {
      "_comment": "python.org's own build as a NuGet package: the same signed binaries as its installer (Smart App Control lets them run; uv's downloaded Python it may block), unpacked, nothing registered in Windows",
