    "rtxvsr": {
      "_comment": "RTX Video (1080p / 4K / HDR10 in the final): rtx_vsr.exe with NVIDIA's nvngx DLLs, shipped inside the installer (desktop/resources/rtxvsr, built by tools/rtxvsr/build.ps1); licensed under the NVIDIA RTX Video SDK license, not this repository's",
      "approxBytes": 60000000
    },
    "music": {
      "_comment": "The words of a song: Whisper large-v3 (faster-whisper) and Demucs htdemucs (demucs 4.1 takes it from Hugging Face), both into HF_HOME, fetched by the engine's own code so the app never downloads mid-job",
